ng a supply  run on a mission for revenge henry  insisted on joining carroll in the fight  against the saviors proving himself a  valuable member in the battle against  negan henry who was adopted by ezekiel  and carroll during the season 9 time  jump was also known as prince henry  initially portrayed by maxon lynch henry  became a 17 year old young man seemingly  overnight and matlins took over the role  from his younger brother the lint's  family had a long history with the  walking dead their sister madison lynch  played carol's daughter sofia in seasons  one and two the older henry moved to the  hilltop colony became a blacksmith's  apprentice and fell in love with lydia a  former whisperer whose mother alpha  disowned her after she formed a bond  with daryl dixon and others from the  communities including henry alpha  captured and killed henry by  decapitation as a message to her  daughter and the others marking the end  of the lindsay's appearances on the show  few walking dead characters have been as  beloved as glenrie whose death at the  hands of negan in season six hits fans  hard and served a huge blow to the show  when fans found the scene outrageous  fortunately the character has lived on  through his son with wife maggie outside  of ultrasound images herschel re made  his first appearance on the show in  season 9 as a baby only to age 6 years  after rick's supposed death he's just  perfect he really is maggie and herschel  left hilltop for georgie's group so they  wouldn't be near negan but they're  expected to play a large part in the  upcoming final season during his time on  the show young herschel has been  portrayed by three actors including  peyton lockridge in season 9 and the  most recent actor kian michael spiller  the young boy wears a hat reminiscent of  glenn's from season one and two and he  seems to have a gentle nature just like  his grandfather only time will tell what  the future holds for the son of one of  the show's most popular co